  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這個模組將頂級掠食者——斑鬣狗加入遊戲中，牠們屬於貓形亞目食肉哺乳動物（類似貓的食肉動物）。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這些機會主義的肉食動物會在有機會時立即發動狩獵。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你有10%的低機率馴服牠們，讓牠們不會攻擊你或你的寵物，但牠們不會跟隨你。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們在進食地面上的食物時會自行療傷（咬噬時也會有少量治療效果！）。</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">當牠們距離目標較遠時會跑得更快，而靠近目標時則會放慢步伐行走</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">一旦距離足夠，便會猛撲過去，最後給予強力一咬。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在拉開足夠距離之前，牠們絕不會讓目標逃脫。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">我提到過牠們也是游泳高手嗎？</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以在沙漠或莽原生態域中找到牠們。（生成率偏低，以免清除世界上所有生物）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在Forge版本中，你可以透過編輯data -> biome tags和biome modifier資料夾中的json檔案，或透過資源包來調整生成設定；而在Fabric版本中則有專用的設定檔。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模組目前支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6&nbsp; | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1360/314/logo-hyena.gif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果你需要在CurseForge上取得其他版本的模組，請發送私訊給我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在X（Twitter）上關注我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝AquariusLibs才能運作</strong></a></span></p>",
